To perform sentiment analysis on a given passage using C++, you can use a natural language processing library like NLTK or Stanford NLP. These libraries provide functions to tokenize the passage, extract features, and classify the sentiment of the text.
Here's an example of how to perform sentiment analysis on a passage regarding technological progress using the Stanford NLP library:
```
#include <iostream>
#include <fstream>
